WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
We like to play a quick round of?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.004
Drewth or Dare!
Mm-hmm.

3
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:06.170
(audience cheers)
