Hi, got it!

7
00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:12.450 line:15%
Yes!
Perfect, yes!

8
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.030 line:15%
So I have a Drewth for you both.

9
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:14.863 line:15%
Okay.
Oh.

10
00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:17.500 line:15%
If you were to swap bodies for one day,

11
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.740 line:15%
what is the very first thing you would do

12
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.050
