13
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.161
Oh, oh.
Oh.

14
00:00:24.161 --> 00:00:24.994
Oh.

15
00:00:24.994 --> 00:00:26.727
I would be like, "Whoa."
I know.

16
00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:31.100
That's my honest answer (laughs).

17
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.128
Leave it alone.

18
00:00:33.128 --> 00:00:34.003
(Drew laughs)

19
00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:35.624
(Ross laughs)

20
00:00:35.624 --> 00:00:37.660
What would you do?

21
00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:38.670
What, oh, nothing.

22
00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.390
Nothing like that.

23
00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.290
I can't help it, if you woke up,

24
00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:43.740
