25
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:47.180
that would be the first thing I would think to marvel at.

26
00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.580
Where your brain goes is so funny.

27
00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:50.620
Right to the potty.

28
00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.120
Yeah, right?

29
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.270
Well, gosh, I wish I did wake up in your body, Ross

30
00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:58.320
because here's what would really happen.

31
00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.980
Yeah.

32
00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:00.813
(Ross chuckles)

33
00:01:00.813 --> 00:01:02.300
I would be to disciplined

34
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.920
'cause sometimes I am not really disciplined.

35
00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.500
And you are really disciplined

36
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.020
