37
00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.116
Oh, you wouldn't eat a whole bowl of mac and cheese?

38
00:01:12.116 --> 00:01:12.949
(Drew chuckles)

39
00:01:12.949 --> 00:01:14.160
Which is what she tries to get me to do

40
00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.993
