41
00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:15.844
I know, no!
You wouldn't do that?

42
00:01:15.844 --> 00:01:20.490
I would be excited that you have strong willpower.

43
00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:21.360
Yeah, thank you.

44
00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.880
Well, it's new, it's new.

45
00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:25.430
(audience laughs)
(Drew laughs)

46
00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:27.290
If I woke up as Drew Barrymore,

47
00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.870
I mean, I would wanna green light

48
00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:30.870
a new Charlie's Angel movie

49
00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:32.130
and cast Ross Matthews as Bosley,

50
00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:33.767
but I wouldn't do that, I wouldn't.

51
00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.530
(audience cheers)

52
00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.900
I would do whatever I could to set you up for the next day

53
00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.960
'until have a day off with your daughters.

54
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:41.910
That's what I would do.

55
00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:44.690
'Cause I know that's what my friend, Drew,

56
00:01:44.690 --> 00:01:46.160
loves more than anything in the world.

57
00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:50.070
I know, God, Ross, what is wrong with me?

58
00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.430
Well...
(Drew chuckles)

59
00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:53.480
All right, all right, let me, God!

60
00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.950
It makes you feel better, I would take a peek.

61
00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:56.617
I would just 'cause.

62
00:01:56.617 --> 00:01:58.674
(audience laughs)

63
00:01:58.674 --> 00:01:59.507
Would you?
'Cause I'd never

64
00:01:59.507 --> 00:02:00.736
seen it, really before.

65
00:02:00.736 --> 00:02:04.871
(Ross laughs)
(Drew laughs)

66
00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:06.400
Liz, aren't, you glad you asked?

67
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.720
I love it, thank you so much.

68
